          },
          {
            "index": 1474,
            "source_segment_index": 1474,
            "start_ms": 3108650,
            "end_ms": 3111050,
            "text": "稍后回来会是我们第三局机械狼通灵师"
          },
          {
            "index": 1475,
            "source_segment_index": 1475,
            "start_ms": 3111050,
            "end_ms": 3112305,
            "text": "一会见"
          },
          {
            "index": 1476,
            "source_segment_index": 1476,
            "start_ms": 3115960,
            "end_ms": 3117780,
            "text": "OK家人们又回来了"
          },
          {
            "index": 1477,
            "source_segment_index": 1477,
            "start_ms": 3117780,
            "end_ms": 3119400,
            "text": "非常精彩的第二局"
          },
          {
            "index": 1478,
            "source_segment_index": 1478,
            "start_ms": 3119400,
            "end_ms": 3120800,
            "text": "盗宝大师的对抗"
          },
          {
            "index": 1479,
            "source_segment_index": 1479,
            "start_ms": 3120800,
            "end_ms": 3123640,
            "text": "我们这几张神牌都非常的优秀啊"
